      "eyepieces_the_other_half_of_the_system": "Eyepieces — the other half of the system",
      "eyes_need_time_to_develop_rod_cell_sen": "Eyes need time to develop rod-cell sensitivity for dim meteors. No phone screens, no white flashlights — use red-light only.",
      "f_c_fraction_that_communicate": "f_c: fraction that communicate",
      "f_i_fraction_that_go_intelligent": "f_i: fraction that go intelligent",
