      "the_duration_of_the_waggle_run_encodes": "The duration of the waggle run encodes distance. ~1 second of waggling ≈ 1 kilometer. A 2-second waggle run means the nectar is about 2km away. Closer sources use a simpler \"round dance\" (no direction info needed).",
