      "tidepooling_under_tropical_sun_is_inte": "Tidepooling under tropical sun is intense. UV-protective clothing, electrolytes, frequent shade breaks. Coral cuts in saltwater heat = infection risk.",
      "tidepools_reefs_are_not_zero_risk_envi": "Tidepools + reefs are not zero-risk environments. Most cephalopods are harmless, but a few are dangerous + share habitat with other hazards.",
