      "if_impact_is_unavoidable": "If impact is unavoidable",
      "if_right_shoulder_is_blocked_stop_wher": " If the right shoulder is blocked, signal and move as far right as practicable, stay clear of intersections, and stop where the lane stays clearest.",
      "if_the_emergency_vehicle_is_on_the_oth": " Maine §2054 does not list a median exception; move right when safe, stay clear of intersections, and stop until it passes.",
      "if_the_examiner_has_to_verbally_correc": "If the examiner has to verbally correct you to prevent danger = fail.",
