      "iq_q_g912": "Your hypothesis: predict the ordering of the three machines by range at 5 kg and at 200 kg, and say which term in m_p/(m_p + m_eff) decides each case.",
      "iq_q_k2": "Which machine do you think throws best? Say why.",
      "iq_sig": "Inquiry widget — no score, no reveal, no answer dump. Nothing here is marked, and the tool will not tell you the answer. The numbers in the table are the tool’s simplified model, not a measurement of any real machine.",
      "iq_stuck": "I'm stuck — show open questions",
